      "t": "2026-11-15T00:00:01Z",
      "text": "According to the reports, three Palestinians were killed and others injured in shelling and shooting attacks by Israeli troops in various areas of the Gaza Strip, in a continuation of the ceasefire violations.",
      "cites": [
        "wiki:2026-11-15:2"
      ]
    },
    {
      "t": "2026-11-15T00:00:08Z",
      "text": "On 15 November 2026, Palestinians in northern Gaza buried the remains of around 70 people recovered from the rubble of buildings in the Jabalia refugee camp and Beit Lahia.",
      "cites": [
        "wiki:rev:1386011506:367"
      ]
    },
    {
      "t": "2026-11-15T00:00:15Z",
      "text": "The Gaza war is an armed conflict in the Gaza Strip and Israel, fought as part of the unresolved Israeli–Palestinian and Gaza–Israel conflicts.",
      "cites": [
        "wiki:rev:1386011506:0"
      ]
    },
    {
      "t": "2026-11-15T00:00:25Z",
